<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="consumables">Consumables</h4>Ideally you choose the consumables that best fit the gear you are currently wearing. Consuming for hit is very strong in this phase, however remember that overcapping through consumables is generally a bad idea and gemming for hit is going to net you greater returns if you are wasting too much hit. Below are the consumes used while designing these sets. For more information you can visit the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-consumables-raid-buffs-pve">Buffs &amp; Consumables Guide</a>
