<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_154.gif");'></span>Bloodvenom Blade w/<wbr/> 4-set Bonus<br/>Full BiS</h4>Your (more or less) ordinary 4-set if you want to utilize the set bonus in any way, we picked <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50672/bloodvenom-blade">
