<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>The only real stand-out in this slot is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50640/broken-ram-skull-helm">
