<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50718/royal-crimson-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Crimson Cloak</span></a> is a solid, well balanced cloak with very high EHP which makes it a very easy shoe-in in almost every set. While cloaks don't generally have any competition within the slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50466/sentinels-winter-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sentinel's Winter Cloak</span></a> may be your saving grace, and consolation prize should nothing drop for you and though while early on it's hard to justify spending 50 emblems on your cloak it's also very accessible to everyone regardless of what difficulty they primarily raid on. For instance the best you can do if you only raid 10-man is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51888/cloak-of-many-skins">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_naxxramas_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Many Skins</span></a>, which is a decent but pretty boring cloak.<div class="box">
<b>Cloak Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47672/enchant-cloak-mighty-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Mighty Armor</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60663/enchant-cloak-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Major Agility</span></a>/<wbr/>
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55002/flexweave-underlay">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flexweave Underlay</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44591/enchant-cloak-titanweave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Titanweave</span></a></div>
