<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51265/sanctified-lightsworn-chestguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Lightsworn Chestguard</span></a> vs <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50681/blightborne-warplate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blightborne Warplate</span></a> boils down to what slots you're utilizing to find hit rating, though since the stat is abundant this phase we are recommending erring on the side of mitigation and survivability against some of the hardest encounters this expansion has to offer. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50968/cataclysmic-chestguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cataclysmic Chestguard</span></a> costs a ton of badges, and while better than its <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51174/sanctified-lightsworn-chestguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Lightsworn Chestguard</span></a> tier counterpart, the small advantages do not outperform the set bonuses the latter can help provide. 10 man raiders can enjoy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51917/ghoul-commanders-cuirass">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ghoul Commander's Cuirass</span></a>, which is a very solid pick up with good ehp.<div class="box">
<b>Chest Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47900/enchant-chest-super-health">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Super Health</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60692/enchant-chest-powerful-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Powerful Stats</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47766/enchant-chest-greater-defense">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Greater Defense</span></a></div>
