<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>Mitigation vs health bar, distinctly different best use-cases, though <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51901/gargoyle-spit-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gargoyle Spit Bracers</span></a> will be overall better if you just wanna equip something and never think about it again.<div class="box">
<b>Wrist Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62256/enchant-bracers-major-stamina">
