<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_thoriumsetting.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a> to their wrists. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">Leatherworkers</a> can also apply resistance enchants which are particularly powerful in this phase such as <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57694/fur-lining-frost-resist">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Frost Resist</span></a>.</div>
