<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>It's almost no contest, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51267/sanctified-lightsworn-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Lightsworn Handguards</span></a> is superb, as you will not be able to reach combat table coverage inside ICC, mitigation stats are somewhat hard to come by with block value being both extinct on gear and unreliable in practice bonus armor is a very solid way for us to augment our survivability. It's even better when it occurs in tandem with a valuable stat like hit. Despite having more stamina, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50716/taldarams-plated-fists">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_87.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Taldaram's Plated Fists</span></a> will serve you worse in general, as avoidance is inherently unreliable compared to mitigation.<div class="box">
<b>Glove Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63770/reticulated-armor-webbing">
