<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50991/verdigris-chain-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Verdigris Chain Belt</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50691/belt-of-broken-bones">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Broken Bones</span></a> comes down to whichever you get first, though when optimizing for survivability <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50991/verdigris-chain-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Verdigris Chain Belt</span></a> will generally just barely edge out however we don't recommend that you drop early emblems on this as the alternatives are solid in their own right if you can get them to drop.<br/>
<br/>10 man raiders will enjoy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51831/ironrope-belt-of-ymirjar">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ironrope Belt of Ymirjar</span></a> as their best raid drop, pretty solid in fact.<div class="box">
<b>Waist Enchants</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41611/eternal-belt-buckle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_36.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Belt Buckle</span></a> is a universal item enhancement for your belt. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">Engineers</a> also get access to a <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54793/frag-belt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frag Belt</span></a>.</div>
