<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>Since bosses see a fairly major increase in their physical and magical lethality this phase, we advise that you try and opt into more specialized survivability items, all the better if they are so accessible as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49904/pillars-of-might">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pillars of Might</span></a> are. When boiled down, what you lose by getting these is a small hit to your overall health pool but off set by a larger increase to your EHP.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51268/sanctified-lightsworn-legguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_33.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Lightsworn Legguards</span></a> are really solid however and if you're doing something like solo tanking Sindragosa, the additional health is potentially substantial though the 4-set bonus here in this case is almost never worth downgrading multiple items in phase 4.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50612/legguards-of-lost-hope">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Lost Hope</span></a> is a solid alternative, but hit is not a huge factor for us in this phase, it is pretty abundant and occurs on slots with worse competition.<div class="box">
<b>Leg Enchants</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38373/frosthide-leg-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frosthide Leg Armor</span></a>. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">Leatherworkers</a> can make their own <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60583/jormungar-leg-reinforcements">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jormungar Leg Reinforcements</span></a>.</div>
