<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-protection-paladin-tank-phase-1">Neck for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 1</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50682/bile-encrusted-medallion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaceb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bile-Encrusted Medallion</span></a> family of necklaces provide the highest EHP, maximizing our survivability out of the neck slot, however <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50627/noose-of-malachite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklacec.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Noose of Malachite</span></a> is a solid neck that rightfully contests the slot. It boils down to whether you think you need survivability, or if you can utilize the additional hit.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51934/marrowgars-scratching-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Marrowgar's Scratching Choker</span></a> from 10 man is the most quintessential tanking neck this phase, while lacking the specialization into hit or mitigation like the alternatives, still makes for a decent upgrade from phase 3.<div class="pad"></div>
