<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>Ilevel is primarily what dictate which rings you'll use, though stand-out is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50622/deviums-eternally-cold-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_86.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Devium's Eternally Cold Ring</span></a> (and its derivatives) which comes with a normal stamina package but also armor which helps us maximize the potential survivability out of this ring slot. Phase 4 rings give you an abundance of hit options, which may serve you very well while progressing and gearing though should be mostly obsolete once BiS unless you are trying to optimize for DPS. Something to look out for is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49489/signified-ring-of-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signified Ring of Binding</span></a> which keeps a level of relevance in this phase, with the occasional utility of resistance this ring has an abundance of strong survivability stats.<br/>
<br/>Once you outgear the rep ring you can opt into <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=52572/ashen-band-of-endless-might">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_81.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ashen Band of Endless Might</span></a>, a very solid offensive option, practically everything about this ring is perfectly statted for us (DPS wise).<div class="box">
<b>Ring Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59636/enchant-ring-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Stamina</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.</div>
