<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>Players coming into phase 4 will see a major increase in performance over their phase 3 weapons. Unfortunately, we are still competing for the best DPS weapons in the game and we ask players to review their own and their fellow raiders gear before trying to argue tank prio. Otherwise situation largely mirrors that of p1 to p2 for us in terms of qualitative upgrades, especially if you are still running phase 2 weapons. The main points are that non dagger <a class="icontiny c4" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/rogue">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_rogue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rogue</span></a>
<span class="c4">s</span> and dual-wield <a class="icontiny c6" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/death-knight">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_deathknight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Knight</span></a>
<span class="c6">s</span> gain significantly more than us from this weapon upgrade (to the point of almost twice as much).<br/>
<br/>if you're able to, getting your hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51520/wrathful-gladiators-truncheon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_120.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrathful Gladiator's Truncheon</span></a> is very powerful this phase, it is essentially exactly what we want from a weapon, it offers very high stamina on top of its potent offensive properties while not contesting weapons from DPS players who will likely get more mileage out of their upgrades than you will. However it has a steep buy in, requiring high arena rating to purchase.<div class="box">
<b>Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64579/enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
