<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="librams">Librams for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="librams">Librams for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>While this patch introduces the peak avoidance libram in the game in the form of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50461/libram-of-the-eternal-tower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of the Eternal Tower</span></a> for us, it's still not that good and we'll generally prefer the great dps endowed by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47661/libram-of-valiance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_libramofhope.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of Valiance</span></a> in most circumstances. Avoidance just runs into the problem of being too unreliable. You can certainly wear it and you will (probably) dodge more often, whether these dodges are critical or not is a different matter.<div class="pad"></div>
